               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospital admission of your 74-year-old male patient, who presented on 01/02/2021 with fever, progressive dyspnoea, and dry cough. A nasopharyngeal SARS-CoV-2 PCR test confirmed COVID-19. Chest X-ray and CT thorax demonstrated bilateral peripheral infiltrates consistent with COVID-19 pneumonia. Blood tests revealed elevated CRP and lymphopenia. Oxygen saturation on admission was 88% on room air. The patient was treated with supplemental oxygen therapy, dexamethasone, and anticoagulation. Continuous pulse oximetry monitoring was performed. His condition gradually improved, and he was mobilised with physiotherapy support. At discharge, oxygen saturation was stable at 95% on room air. He is discharged home with instructions regarding isolation, gradual activity increase, and follow-up. Please arrange a follow-up appointment within two weeks. Do not hesitate to contact me for further information.</div>
               </text>
